{"id":"14fc2af0ac27dcbb","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-cantor-bendixson.md","title":"闭类的导集、超限迭代与点秩","display":"df-cantor-bendixson — 闭类的导集、超限迭代与点秩","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-cantor-bendixson","aliases":["20-df-cantor-bendixson"],"display":"df-cantor-bendixson — 闭类的导集、超限迭代与点秩","chapter":"8","section":"8.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definitions 8.7.5–8.7.6（拓扑形式）","source_printed_pages":[172],"source_pdf_pages":[205],"depends_on":["[[20-df-cantor-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-cantor-bendixson"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-cantor-bendixson</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cantor-bendixson — 闭类的导集、超限迭代与点秩"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 8.7.5–8.7.6（拓扑形式）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>172</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>205</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span> 闭；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 为序数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 为不属于序数的秩标记。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor-bendixson}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD(C):=\\{X\\in C:\\forall n\\ \\exists Y\\in C\\ [Y\\ne X\\land X\\upharpoonright n=Y\\upharpoonright n]\\},\\\\\nC^{[0]}=C,\\qquad C^{[\\alpha+1]}=D(C^{[\\alpha]}),\\qquad\nC^{[\\lambda]}=\\bigcap_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}C^{[\\alpha]}\\quad(\\lambda\\text{ 非零极限}),\\\\\n\\rho_C(X):=\\begin{cases}\\min\\{\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1:X\\in C^{[\\alpha]}\\setminus C^{[\\alpha+1]}\\}&amp;\\text{该集合非空},\\\\\n\\infty&amp;\\text{该集合为空}\\end{cases}\\quad(X\\in C).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor-bendixson}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD(C):=\\{X\\in C:\\forall n\\ \\exists Y\\in C\\ [Y\\ne X\\land X\\upharpoonright n=Y\\upharpoonright n]\\},\\\\\nC^{[0]}=C,\\qquad C^{[\\alpha+1]}=D(C^{[\\alpha]}),\\qquad\nC^{[\\lambda]}=\\bigcap_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}C^{[\\alpha]}\\quad(\\lambda\\text{ 非零极限}),\\\\\n\\rho_C(X):=\\begin{cases}\\min\\{\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1:X\\in C^{[\\alpha]}\\setminus C^{[\\alpha+1]}\\}&amp;\\text{该集合非空},\\\\\n\\infty&amp;\\text{该集合为空}\\end{cases}\\quad(X\\in C).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1+1\">\\(\\omega_1+1\\)</span> 的集合长度上作超限递归，值都属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\\)</span>，故不是在对象语言量化真类。点秩以首次成为孤立点的层计。性质不是有效秩计算的声明；可计算树也可能需要不可计算的导集。闭性及稳定化在下一定理验证。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 8.7.5–8.7.6（拓扑形式）；印刷页 172；PDF 第 205 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor-bendixson}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD(C):=\\{X\\in C:\\forall n\\ \\exists Y\\in C\\ [Y\\ne X\\land X\\upharpoonright n=Y\\upharpoonright n]\\},\\\\\nC^{[0]}=C,\\qquad C^{[\\alpha+1]}=D(C^{[\\alpha]}),\\qquad\nC^{[\\lambda]}=\\bigcap_{\\alpha<\\lambda}C^{[\\alpha]}\\quad(\\lambda\\text{ 非零极限}),\\\\\n\\rho_C(X):=\\begin{cases}\\min\\{\\alpha<\\omega_1:X\\in C^{[\\alpha]}\\setminus C^{[\\alpha+1]}\\}&\\text{该集合非空},\\\\\n\\infty&\\text{该集合为空}\\end{cases}\\quad(X\\in C).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega_1+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)","display":false}],"bytes":1671,"backlinks":[{"id":"60a10f7c9ce5cbb7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]。"},{"id":"aae185fc93a18a8a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]；see [[20-ex-bounded-zero-rank]]。"},{"id":"4ffcd8be1ef80ce4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-extendible]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]；see [[20-thm-konig]]；see [[20-thm-rel-post]]。"},{"id":"30c9fe5076745a2a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-d